<title>USA: Alex. Brown holders approve Bankers Trust merger.</title>
<headline>Alex. Brown holders approve Bankers Trust merger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust New York Corp said Wednesday that shareholders of Alex. Brown Inc approved the planned merger of the two firms.</p>
<p>Earlier Wednesday, Bankers Trust shareholders by a wide margin approved the issuance of 25.96 million shares pursuant to the merger.</p>
<p>The merger, valued at $1.7 billion when announced in April, is expected to close on September 1, Bankers Trust said.</p>
</text>
